1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,130
W: How is your newest employee working out?

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,240
M: Do you mean Ted?

3
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:04,720
He's doing really well.

4
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,840
Thanks so much for recommending him to me.

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:13,085
W: We both worked at Lensman Technology a couple of years ago, so I'm familiar with the quality of the work he does.

6
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:16,460
M: He definitely works harder than anyone else in my department.

7
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,620
In fact, he'll probably get a promotion pretty soon.

8
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,340
W: Already?

9
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,315
That's rather fast, isn't it?

10
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,455
M: Somewhat, but he should be rewarded for doing such good work.

11
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:29,610
And it might inspire the others in my department to try a bit harder as well.
